msgid "list [installed], groups, install <group>, remove <group|all>, update, auto <status|enable|disable|run>, status, profiles, preview <file>, import <file>, tokens, register-token <module>, unregister-token, gpgsm-import <group>, gpgsm-remove <group|all>, gpgsm-status, gpgsm-confirm"
msgstr "list [installed], groups, install <group>, remove <group|all>, update, auto <status|enable|disable|run>, status, profiles, preview <file>, import <file>, tokens, register-token <module>, unregister-token, gpgsm-import <group>, gpgsm-remove <group|all>, gpgsm-status, gpgsm-confirm"

